What does this program print? Write the lines separated by single spaces.

```sql
CREATE TABLE emp (name TEXT, dept TEXT, salary INTEGER);
INSERT INTO emp VALUES
  ('Ayo', 'eng', 70), ('Bea', 'eng', 90), ('Cai', 'eng', 80),
  ('Dov', 'ops', 50), ('Eva', 'ops', 65);
SELECT name FROM emp AS e
WHERE salary > (SELECT avg(salary) FROM emp AS f WHERE f.dept = e.dept)
ORDER BY name;
```

How many rows does the recursive CTE produce?

```sql
CREATE TABLE folder (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT, parent_id INTEGER);
INSERT INTO folder VALUES (1, 'root', NULL), (2, 'photos', 1), (3, 'docs', 1),
  (4, '2025', 2), (5, '2026', 2), (6, 'june', 5), (7, 'taxes', 3);
WITH RECURSIVE sub(id) AS (
  SELECT id FROM folder WHERE name = 'photos'
  UNION ALL
  SELECT f.id FROM folder AS f JOIN sub ON f.parent_id = sub.id
)
SELECT count(*) FROM sub;
```
